<https://id.i2idl.org/concepts/user-tailored-privacy> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "A privacy approach in which a system models an individual learner's privacy concerns and adapts privacy information, recommendations, or decision support to that user." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/user-tailored-privacy/versions/1> .
